Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:08.42,Title,0,0,0,0,,《饥饿游戏3： 嘲笑鸟（上）》
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.44,1:18:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,9\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.60,1:18:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,8\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.80,1:18:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,7\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.32,1:18:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,6\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.32,1:18:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,4\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.96,1:18:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,3\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.00,1:18:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,1\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.80,1:32:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,10\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.12,1:32:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,9 8\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine… Eight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.40,1:32:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,7 6 5\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven… Six… Five…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.84,1:32:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,4 3 2\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four… Three… Two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.60,1:32:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,1\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,长话短说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with what you know is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是凯妮丝·艾佛丁 我家住在12区\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Katniss Everdeen. My home is District 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经被迫参加饥饿游戏 但我逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in the Hunger Games. I escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德… 他没有逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta… Peeta was left behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾佛丁小姐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Everdeen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:00:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做噩梦了 再给我5分钟就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a nightmare. Just five more minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要睡眠 我们可以帮助你入睡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to sleep. We can help you sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我5分钟就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just five more minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 我只要5分钟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please, don't. It's just five more…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我 不 不 放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me! Don't! No! No! Get off of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finnick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想回去找比德和乔安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to go back for Peeta and Johanna, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我动不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把安妮也抓走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have Annie, too. They took her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她… 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.56,0:02:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在在都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish she was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我们所有人都可以死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish they were all dead and we were, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.96,0:03:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾佛丁小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Everdeen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.64,0:03:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是伯格斯上校 第13区的保安队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Boggs, District 13's head of security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你刚出院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you've been discharged, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是科因总统希望先见见你本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but President Coin's requested to meet with you first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.04,0:03:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有新的消息吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我只是被指派来护送你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just here to escort you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经都以为13区只剩下一片残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were always told there was nothing left of 13.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城把13区的表面炸成了废墟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capitol bombed the surface to rubble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们军人 我们学会了生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're military, so we learned to survive down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,时刻准备 不停训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preparing, training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的战争不曾终止\N{\fnArial\fs30}The war never stopped for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.48,0:04:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们燃烧的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Girl on Fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统阁下 请让我向您介绍嘲笑鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President, may I present you with The Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.24,0:05:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an honor it is to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是勇敢的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a courageous young woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 这一定令人很困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how disorienting this must be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.88,0:05:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全无法想象你是如何在这残忍的游戏里生存下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't imagine what it's like to live through the atrocities of those Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是 阿尔玛·科因总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}President Alma Coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能来这里太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please know how welcome you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你在13区能过得舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you'll find some comfort with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,13区也损失惨重\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've known loss in 13, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是历史性的一刻 就在这桌子前\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is history. Right here at this table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望你有更多时间休息 但很不幸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you had more time to recover, but unfortunately, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们没有那个时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't have that luxury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, have a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道最近都发生了些什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you aware of what's happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.52,0:05:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你将你的弓箭射向天空\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you fired your arrow at the force field{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你点燃了整个国家的战火\N{\fnArial\fs30}you electrified the nation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让7个区群情激愤 起来反抗都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}There have been riots and uprisings and strikes in seven districts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:06:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信 如果我们能保持这股激情\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe that if we keep this energy going{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.33,0:06:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以联合更多区来反抗都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can unify the districts against the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不动作 让机会跑掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we don't, if we let it dissipate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们恐怕得再等75年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could be waiting another 75 years for this opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,13区的人都已经在为了这一战做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone in 13 is ready for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德呢？他还活着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Peeta? Is he alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我也希望我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. And I wish that I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法联络上我在都城的内应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's no way for me to contact my operatives inside the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城阻断了区与区的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Capitol has always suppressed communication between the districts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我很了解他们的系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know their system very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责寻找方法突破\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed to break through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们还需要一条讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we need now is the perfect message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯 这是我们现在需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss, here's what we need to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让其他人看到嘲笑鸟还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to show them that The Mockingjay's alive and well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,激励他们起来反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and willing to stand up and join this fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们需要联合所有区来反抗都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we need every district to stand up to this Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.56,0:06:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就如同你射向天空那箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要拍摄一段宣传短片\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're gonna shoot a series of propaganda clips, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,采访 我喜欢称它为\N{\fnArial\fs30}propos, I like to call them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑鸟计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}on The Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要它传开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spreads the word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:07:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要点燃暴动的战火\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we're gonna stoke the fire of this rebellion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从嘲笑鸟开始的反抗之火\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fire that The Mockingjay started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他留在哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left him there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把比德留在竞技场等死 - 凯妮斯 那里有很多…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You left Peeta in that arena to die. - Katniss, there are so many…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德才是该活下来的那一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta was the one who was supposed to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾佛丁小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Everdeen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.52,0:07:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,革命是每个人的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This revolution is about everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.64,0:07:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们需要一个发言人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need a voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你那个时候就该救比德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you should've saved Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你那个时候就应该救他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should have rescued the boy instead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道的 这是没人可以做得比他更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen to me. No one else can do this but her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是她看起来不如你形容得这么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not the girl you described.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 我应该和她私下谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, we need to make it personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒她真正的敌人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind her who the real enemy is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.56,0:07:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道的 这不是问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows who the enemy is. That's not the issue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非她忘记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless she's forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要给她看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's explaining and there's showing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他看看都城对12区做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her see what the Capitol did to 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她根本不能处理好 那游戏已经毁了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't handle it. The Games destroyed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.00,0:08:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是我们唯一的机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only choice you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会如你所愿的做事 总统阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't always show up the way you want them to, Madam President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that anger, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.66,0:08:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以促使反对派起义 这就是我们想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that anger-driven defiance, that's what we want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以换个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can redirect it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要联合所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to unite these people out there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是在赛场上自相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}that have been doing nothing but killing each other in an arena for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须有一个导火索\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to have a lightning rod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们就会跟随她 她是反抗行动的领路人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll follow her. She's the face of the revolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她去明白 让她回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her see it. Let her go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,送她去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信在发生那些事之后 你有勇气回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you're going through with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.20,0:09:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以拒绝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can say "no."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要亲眼看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see it for myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,13区检查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}13 swept everything, top to bottom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you'd be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定不需要我跟着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you don't want me to go with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在空中看照你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have our eyes on you from above.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.96,0:13:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想看到普里姆吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you wanna see Prim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.84,0:14:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 你真是伤透我的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go. You're breakin' my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱吉莉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Egeria!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.52,0:15:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要纠正几个词汇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to fix these lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.52,0:15:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会称他们为「反叛军」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't say "rebels."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵抗是徒劳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are senseless acts of defiance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.32,0:15:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让它看起来合法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I won't legitimize them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会叫他们「罪犯」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll call them "criminals."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,激进份子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Radicals."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则就坏了我的老规矩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise we're breaking my oldest rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.24,0:15:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让敌人看到你弱的那一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never let them see you bleed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,市民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Citizens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我要说所有施惠国统一了\N{\fnArial\fs30}tonight I address all of Panem as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从那些黑暗的日子之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the Dark Days, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.84,0:16:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,施惠国已经过了一段史无前例的和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Panem has had an unprecedented era of peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这份和平是大家共同努力的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a peace built upon cooperation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵从命令 守法纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a respect for law and order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.80,0:16:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在这几周来 一些零星的暴动\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the past weeks, you have heard of sporadic violence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.40,0:16:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着世纪极限赛里的激进份子暴动\N{\fnArial\fs30}following the actions of a few radicals in the Quarter Quell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些选择毁灭之路的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who choose this destructive path, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都误会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your actions are based on a misunderstanding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要如何与我们和睦相处\N{\fnArial\fs30}of how we have survived. Together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.24,0:16:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要携手合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a contract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个区都供给着都城 就像用血供给着心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each district supplies the Capitol. Like blood to a heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.64,0:16:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,做为回馈 都城提供秩序 安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}In return, the Capitol provides order and security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.28,0:16:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人罢工\N{\fnArial\fs30}To refuse work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会让我们整个系统陷入危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to put the entire system in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城是施惠国的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Capitol is the beating heart of Panem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有心脏 施惠国将不复存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can survive without a heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.88,0:17:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪在你们面前的不法之徒 使用标识来煽动暴乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The criminals that kneel before you use symbols for the purpose of sedition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么所有嘲笑鸟的标识 均应予以禁止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why all images of The Mockingjay are now forbidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,包庇他们的人会被视为叛国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possessing them will be considered treason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,判死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punishable by death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,正义应该被伸张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Justice shall be served swiftly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,秩序应该被保存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order shall be restored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于那些谁无视和平历史的警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}To those who ignore the warnings of history…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就该付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}…prepare to pay the ultimate price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.72,0:18:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.40,0:18:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.44,0:18:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buttercup!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我偷偷带进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smuggled him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有拿爸的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.04,0:18:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有拿一些你放在厨房的药草\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got some of your herbs from the kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have strict rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他们发现猫会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what they'll do if they find him here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.24,0:19:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该吃点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should try to eat something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.56,0:19:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好 晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Good evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.72,0:19:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎施惠国的大家收看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a big welcome to all in Panem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是 凯撒·佛利克曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Caesar Flickerman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是谁 或正在做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whoever you are, whatever it is you're doing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在工作 放下手头的活\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're working, put down your work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果您在吃饭 那么请停下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're having dinner, stop having dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我要你们见证今晚这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you are going to want to witness this tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.48,0:19:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要揭密世纪极限赛事件的内幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has been rampant speculation about what really happened in the Quarter Quell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.08,0:20:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经出现了很多猜测 而要澄清这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here to shed a little light on the subject for us is a very special guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们邀请比德·梅尔拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please welcome Mr. Peeta Mellark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德 很多人搞不清发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta, a lot of people feel as though they are in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.72,0:20:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我知道那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know how they feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 可以说一说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, so set the stage for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底事情是怎么发生的吗？在那争论性的那一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk us through what really happened on that final and controversial night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.96,0:20:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我希望你们先了解 当你置身于游戏中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, first off, you have to understand that when you're in the Games{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只会想着一件事 赌一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}you only get one wish. It's very costly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.28,0:20:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It costs your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.36,0:20:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这代价不止是生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it costs more than your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.64,0:20:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？不止是生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you mean? What's more than your life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀害无辜的人 这比失去要沉重\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean to murder innocent people, that costs everything that you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.00,0:20:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你只能把希望寄托于一件事上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you hold on to that one wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我所希望的就是凯妮斯活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that night my wish was to save Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.48,0:20:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天我应该早跑 应该听她的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've just run off with her earlier in the day like she'd wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.68,0:20:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么呢？你太在意比堤的计划了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Were you caught up in Beetee's plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:21:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我太在意和他们结盟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I was caught up trying to play allies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们分化我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they separated us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.88,0:21:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就因此失去了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's when I lost her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.04,0:21:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而当那闪电击中大树\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the lightning hit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个竞技场的电磁场都毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the whole force field around the arena just blew out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 比德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but, Peeta, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那是凯妮斯打爆电磁场的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss is the one who blew it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.80,0:21:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过镜头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw the footage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她当时不知道她在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she didn't know what she was doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither of us knew{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.56,0:21:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这背后还有阴谋 根本没这个想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was a bigger plan going on. We had no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们都不知道？- 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You had no idea? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 比德 但是看起来十分起疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, Peeta, there are many who find this suspicious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 的确是这样的 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to say the least. - Mmm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.04,0:21:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来她也参与了叛乱计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems as though she was part of a rebel plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.48,0:21:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她会计划自己差点被乔安娜杀死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think it was part of her plan to be almost killed by Johanna?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者差点被闪电杀死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or part of the plan to be paralyzed by lightning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.04,0:21:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们没参与叛乱计划 我们不知道事情会变成这么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we were not part of any rebel plan. We had no idea what was going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们相信你 谢谢你 比德·梅尔拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I believe you, Peeta Mellark. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.36,0:21:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.44,0:21:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该要问你对于叛乱份子的看法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was going to ask you to speak about the unrest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.76,0:21:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想你可能太难过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think you might be too upset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.68,0:22:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure? - Yeah, absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.48,0:22:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.56,0:22:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望大家停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everyone who's watching to stop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想这些叛乱的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to think about what a civil war could mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.56,0:22:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经面临过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}We almost went extinct once before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.04,0:22:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在人口急剧下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now our numbers are even fewer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.88,0:22:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是他们的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.92,0:22:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们希望的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this really what we wanna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.16,0:22:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a traitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.28,0:22:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死我们所有人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill ourselves off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮不能解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing is not the answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.84,0:22:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信他会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe he's doing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.60,0:22:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家应该要马上放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone needs to lay down their weapons immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.96,0:22:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是我们的一份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not one of us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.92,0:22:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is treason!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.28,0:22:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在呼吁大家停火吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you calling for a ceasefire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.28,0:22:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.16,0:22:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一个傀儡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a puppet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.40,0:22:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,吊死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望大家停止无意义的暴力行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everyone to stop the senseless violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.28,0:22:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一条对的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not the path to change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.04,0:22:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.36,0:22:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是条正义的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the path to justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.32,0:23:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能有任何停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}There can't be a ceasefire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.16,0:23:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是看到诺斯的暴行后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not after everything Snow's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.68,0:23:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚比德的话造成了很多不良影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could have done a lot of damage tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多区的人 还不敢挺身反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most districts, people are still too afraid to join.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.20,0:23:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need the courage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他为什么会这样说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think he said that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 或许他是被强迫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe he was forced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他看起来好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't look that bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.96,0:23:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他为了保护你 而达成的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he made some kind of deal to protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.48,0:23:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还身陷游戏之中无法自拔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still playing the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.04,0:24:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.20,0:24:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 我刚做了恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. It's just a nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.36,0:24:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我也经常这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. I get 'em, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.72,0:24:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.04,0:24:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以陪陪我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you stay with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.64,0:24:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.40,0:24:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.84,0:24:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡不着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.28,0:25:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说怎么了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.16,0:25:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很善于保守秘密的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good at keeping secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.92,0:25:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对妈妈也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even from Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.04,0:25:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人比我更讨厌都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one hates the Capitol more than me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.76,0:25:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮忙 但我总想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanna help. But I just keep thinking, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.48,0:25:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算赢了 比德怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if we win this war, what happens to Peeta?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.24,0:25:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里不安全 在这里也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he's not safe there, but he's definitely not safe here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.84,0:25:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你不了解 你对其他人来说也多重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you know how important you are to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.88,0:25:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想要什么 你可以开口和他们谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want something, you just have to ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.88,0:25:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几乎可以要求任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could demand almost anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.68,0:25:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都会答应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd have to agree to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.36,0:25:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该多和你聊天的 小丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should wake you up more often, Little Duck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.48,0:26:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡觉把吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some sleep now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.52,0:26:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.64,0:26:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for agreeing to meet with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.28,0:26:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定要帮助你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've decided I'll be your Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.16,0:26:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我有几个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have some conditions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.32,0:26:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德和其他参赛者 乔安娜·梅森 安妮·克莱斯塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta and the other Tributes, Johanna Mason and Annie Cresta, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.80,0:26:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应当在第一时间获救\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be rescued at the earliest opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.32,0:26:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果比德被解救\N{\fnArial\fs30}If and when Peeta is liberated, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.60,0:26:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的罪刑无条件赦免\N{\fnArial\fs30}he will receive a full and unconditional pardon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.20,0:26:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会受到任何惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No punishment will be inflicted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.40,0:26:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他参与者也同样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the same goes for the other Tributes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.84,0:26:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.92,0:26:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有错 是你把他们留在竞技场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not their fault you abandoned them in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会这样说只是为了生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're doing and saying whatever they can to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.04,0:26:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,13区不允许有个人的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Individuals don't make demands in 13.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.80,0:26:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有一场公正的审判的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be a tribunal. And a fair judgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.64,0:27:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.28,0:27:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利者应当有豁免权才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Victors will be granted immunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.52,0:27:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须在13区所有人面前宣布他们无罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will announce that in front of the entire population of 13.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.96,0:27:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要用你的权力来完成这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will hold yourself and your government responsible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.72,0:27:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然你就找另一只嘲笑鸟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you will find another Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.12,0:27:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有 我就说了 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. That's her. Right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.64,0:27:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是跟你保证过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that who I promised you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.56,0:27:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当她穿上戏服\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wears the costume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.52,0:27:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,背景弄上炮火 硝烟滚滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunfire in the background. A hint of smoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.28,0:27:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们要的嘲笑鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统阁下 我们遭受了挫折 因为人人看不到信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President, we're losing ground, because the people are losing heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.84,0:27:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这值得冒这个险\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is worth the risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.08,0:27:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是值得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's worth the risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.92,0:27:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,赦免他们 法庭 人民权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardons, tribunals. Power of the people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.44,0:27:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是打造新的施惠国所需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can all be the bedrock of the new Panem, but, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.92,0:27:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了这一件 我想可以做一点小小的让步 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in wartime I think even the noblest of causes can be bent a little bit. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.32,0:27:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有别的要求吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any other conditions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.16,0:27:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹可以养猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister gets to keep her cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.60,0:28:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.64,0:28:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又是探访时间了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it visiting hours again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.36,0:28:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,特林奇小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Trinket, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.16,0:28:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you see this door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.36,0:28:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个门也是可以从里面打开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It opens. From the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.44,0:28:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 这是这里生活的人 人人平等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've told you, these are the standard living quarters. Same as everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.04,0:28:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是犯人 在13区您可以自由的活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a prisoner. You're free to join the rest of 13.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.56,0:28:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉不到这样 但还是谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not looking like this. Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.32,0:28:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有比衣服更大的问题吗 特林奇小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a bigger issue than wardrobe, Miss Trinket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.48,0:28:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯答应成为嘲笑鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss has agreed to be The Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.28,0:28:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That poor thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.76,0:28:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃烧的女孩已经快筋疲力尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your Girl on Fire is burnt out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.48,0:28:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to join this team now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.20,0:28:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要有他信任的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need someone she trusts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.12,0:28:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑密契呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Haymitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.84,0:29:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在下面一英里的地方隔离着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's drying out in some facility a mile down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.76,0:29:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助反叛者并不是我的强项\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aiding rebels is not really my forte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.40,0:29:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,特林奇小姐 不管这里将发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Trinket, your days in the Capitol are over, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.12,0:29:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在都城的日子都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what happens here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.92,0:29:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想要当个战犯 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanna play a prisoner of war, fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就留在这里等死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here and rot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.72,0:29:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到其他人的成为嘲笑鸟的陪护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find someone else to be The Mockingjay's escort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.28,0:29:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.92,0:29:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都可以被取代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone can be replaced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.28,0:29:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但嘲笑鸟只有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not your Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.16,0:29:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有人比我了解凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't a soul in this dungeon who knows the first thing about Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.28,0:29:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的认为这里的穴居人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honestly believe one of these cave dwellers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.00,0:29:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以取代我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is going to take my place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.96,0:29:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.36,0:30:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.40,0:30:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 打扰了各位的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for interrupting your schedules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.60,0:30:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经进行了调整 以补偿各位…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have already been adjusted to compensate for the delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.08,0:30:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎没看过有小孩子在这里出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hardly ever see children around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.68,0:30:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请检查你们的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, check in with your unit supervisors when you resume work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.88,0:30:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多小孩死于几年前的瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of them were lost in an epidemic a few years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.72,0:30:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有事情要对13区的人宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an announcement for the citizens of 13.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.08,0:30:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,科因那时也失去了亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coin lost her family, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.04,0:30:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,女儿和丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daughter and a husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.80,0:30:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们12区的嘉宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our welcome guests from 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.40,0:30:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯·艾佛丁已经决定要帮助我们反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss Everdeen has consented to be the face of our cause{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.04,0:30:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助我们联合其他区 反抗都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help unite the districts against the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.04,0:30:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了达成协议 我同意了几个要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange, I have promised several concessions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.12,0:30:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我们会先抢救在都城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, we'll assess all opportunities for the extraction of the Victors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.28,0:30:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些被挟持住的参赛者\N{\fnArial\fs30}held hostage in the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.60,0:30:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德·梅尔拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta Mellark…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.08,0:30:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔安娜·梅森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johanna Mason…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.20,0:30:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬妮克 我也跟安妮谈好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finnick, I made the deal for Annie, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.60,0:30:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有安妮·克莱斯塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Annie Cresta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.68,0:31:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦成功救出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once freed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.04,0:31:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们所有的罪刑将被赦免\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will be granted full pardon for any and all crimes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.04,0:31:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,赦免他对我们的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}committed against the rebel cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.00,0:31:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.72,0:31:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.56,0:31:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果凯妮斯·艾佛丁没有办法达成她的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Katniss Everdeen fails to fulfill her duties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.96,0:31:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易就不再算数\N{\fnArial\fs30}the deal will be off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.84,0:31:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们的聆听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.80,0:31:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,请继续你的日常生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, resume your daily schedules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.20,0:31:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.32,0:31:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃菲·特林奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Effie Trinket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.84,0:31:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到13区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to 13.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.48,0:31:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统阁下 我可以说你真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President, may I say you are so very{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.40,0:31:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 简明扼要 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- concise. - Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.56,0:31:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我还要补充什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe that there's more to be said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.88,0:31:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以坦率地说吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I speak freely?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.96,0:31:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见你说任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't appear to do anything else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.56,0:31:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想谈我们的说服力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only talking about salesmanship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.92,0:31:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓的革命应 往往是星星之火\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing with revolutions, they're a tender flame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.28,0:31:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要加入热情和热情来煽动\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need to be nurtured with a little kindling and warmth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.08,0:31:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,也要氧气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of oxygen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.32,0:31:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,氧气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxygen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.32,0:32:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,平淡如水只会熄灭火种\N{\fnArial\fs30}One sure way to put it out is to smother it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.92,0:32:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,话多也会耗尽屋内氧气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or to use up all the air in the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.68,0:32:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.68,0:32:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道什么东西可以帮助革命吗？发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what could use a revolution? That hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.80,0:32:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃菲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Effie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.20,0:32:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.64,0:32:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.24,0:32:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是个政治难民\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a political refugee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.48,0:32:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,普鲁塔克救你出来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plutarch rescued you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.88,0:32:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我？对 他自己是这样说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rescued, yes, that's what he calls it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.76,0:32:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你和我都眼前一抹黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I were both in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.60,0:32:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要抱怨一下这种穿囚服的烂生活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm condemned to this life of jumpsuits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.08,0:32:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,能见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is wonderful to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.68,0:32:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you believe this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.20,0:32:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念我的咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.40,0:32:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想过竟然会有一个地方这么严格\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never knew anyplace could be so strict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.04,0:32:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我这种高解除人会有些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I thought at least in the higher ranks there'd be some{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.44,0:32:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别待遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}side action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.40,0:32:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想死我的假发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss my wigs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.32,0:33:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好 我记得这个发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luckily, I remembered that this was all the rage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.40,0:33:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初也是很流行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was coming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.08,0:33:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 流行有时会重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, everything old can be made new again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.28,0:33:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是民主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like democracy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.76,0:33:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我来的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which brings me to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.64,0:33:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,西纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cinna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.60,0:33:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead, isn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.64,0:33:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.08,0:33:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他答应普鲁塔克不告诉你这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made Plutarch promise not to show you this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.76,0:33:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你自愿答应我们成为嘲笑鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you'd decided to be The Mockingjay on your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.28,0:33:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道风险很大 我们也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew the risks. As we all do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.72,0:33:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相信这场革命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believed in this revolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.20,0:33:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believed in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.96,0:33:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.96,0:34:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们做好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.96,0:34:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都有嘲笑鸟的服装\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have the Mockingjay outfit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.12,0:34:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在13区这里没有大的筹备组\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not much of a prep team here in 13{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.52,0:34:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们会让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we will make you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.80,0:34:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为史上最漂亮的反叛者的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the best-dressed rebel in history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.64,0:34:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.24,0:34:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯光准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring up the lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.68,0:34:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,西纳的遗作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cinna's final touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.68,0:34:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,送给世界上所有的想要亲吻你的 杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's either gonna wanna kiss you, kill you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.08,0:34:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}or be you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.48,0:34:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.60,0:34:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.24,0:34:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开背景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's bring up the setting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.00,0:35:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.20,0:35:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点点风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Wind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.52,0:35:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 凯妮斯 我们需要你以跪姿出场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Katniss, we're gonna start you down on one knee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.52,0:35:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 当你起身时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - And as you rise up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.56,0:35:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要挥舞旗帜 说出你的台词\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna hold your flag in the air and deliver your line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.12,0:35:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得你刚和都城打完一丈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember you've just stormed the outskirts of the Capitol{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.92,0:35:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的兄弟姊妹一起奋斗完\N{\fnArial\fs30}arm-in-arm with your brothers and sisters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.04,0:35:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.20,0:35:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你准备好就可以开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever you're ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.84,0:35:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,施惠国的各位 我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}People of Panem, we fight, we dare, we…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.88,0:35:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道台词吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she know the line?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.96,0:35:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 我记得 抱歉 - 好的 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know it. I got it. I'm sorry. - Okay, All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.80,0:35:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再来一次吧 - 她是在热身\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's do it again. - She's warming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.56,0:35:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 激情一点 开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. With energy. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.20,0:35:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,施惠国的各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}People of Panem, we fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.92,0:35:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应当勇敢反抗这种不义的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}We dare to end this hunger for justice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.32,0:35:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才刚打完仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just been in battle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.56,0:35:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我忘了我的情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Excuse my outburst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.40,0:35:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要记住你刚打完一场仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just been in battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.88,0:36:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.40,0:36:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever you're ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.76,0:36:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,施惠国的各位 我们反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}People of Panem, we fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.92,0:36:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢的反抗这些不义的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}We dare to end this hunger for justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.60,0:36:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友 这就是革命失败的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that, my friends, is how a revolution dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.24,0:36:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.32,0:36:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这样招呼老朋友的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This how you greet an old friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.44,0:36:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是我认不出清醒的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I don't recognize you sober.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.12,0:36:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想一定很糟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it looks as bad as it feels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.84,0:36:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,施惠国的各位 我们反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}People of Panem, we fight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.64,0:36:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢的反抗这些不义的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}We dare! We end this hunger for justice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.20,0:37:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Madam President, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.32,0:37:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让我稍微放纵一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}indulge me for a moment, if you would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.12,0:37:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's everybody think of one incident{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.64,0:37:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯·艾佛丁曾经在什么时候使你们感动过\N{\fnArial\fs30}where Katniss Everdeen genuinely moved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.00,0:37:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是让他们去羡慕她的发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not where you were jealous of her hairstyle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.48,0:37:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是她的燃烧的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}or her dress went up in flames{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.12,0:37:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是她向天空射了一箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}or she made a halfway decent shot with an arrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.24,0:37:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是和比德的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not where Peeta made you like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.96,0:37:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我希望你们能想起一个时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'd like you all to think of one moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.52,0:37:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要让她感觉到真实的东西 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- where she made you feel something real. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.52,0:37:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在收割日 她为了她妹妹而自愿参加比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she volunteered for her sister at the Reaping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.20,0:37:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个非常好的例子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.84,0:37:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.56,0:37:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望这不是重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that wasn't important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.44,0:37:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 好的 「自愿替妹妹上场」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Okay, "Volunteer for sister."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.68,0:37:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 还有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. What else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.56,0:37:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当她为鲁唱歌时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. When she sang that song for little Rue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.08,0:37:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 谁不被打动呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Who didn't get choked up at that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.36,0:37:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 埃菲 我喜欢没装扮的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I like you better, Effie, without all that makeup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.28,0:38:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比较喜欢清醒的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I like you better sober.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.32,0:38:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,当她和鲁成为盟友的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she chose Rue as an ally, as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.60,0:38:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.44,0:38:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有这些有什么共同之处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what do all these have in common?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.20,0:38:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人告诉她这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one told her what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.40,0:38:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有剧本 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unscripted, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.76,0:38:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 或许我们只须要让她独自一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe we should just leave her alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.24,0:38:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗掉化妆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wash her face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.40,0:38:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是个女孩 你把他搞得像35岁的大妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still a girl. You made her look 35.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.12,0:38:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真情流露的机会很少\N{\fnArial\fs30}The opportunities for spontaneity are obviously{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.88,0:38:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地下避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}lacking below ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.96,0:38:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要我们让她去作战？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what you're suggesting is we toss her into combat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.68,0:38:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让没有受过训练的平民出现在战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sanction putting an untrained civilian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.92,0:38:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争只是为了增加效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}in battle just for effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.04,0:38:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是都成\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.56,0:38:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我认为只要将她放在战场就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is exactly what I'm suggesting. Put her in the field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.52,0:38:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们无法保护他的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we can't protect her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.76,0:38:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是必要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to come from her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.44,0:38:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人民需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what people respond to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.48,0:38:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要一个革命的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a symbol for the revolution?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.24,0:38:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能强迫她表现出任何我们要的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}She cannot be coached into it. Trust me, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.84,0:38:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们就应该找些 比较不这么危险的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there's someplace that's less dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.00,0:38:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,第8区 他们上礼拜才被轰炸而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}District 8. They reported heavy bombing last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.60,0:38:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,已没任何军事目标了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no military targets left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.04,0:38:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有办法保证他的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't guarantee her safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.28,0:38:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远无法保证我的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never be able to guarantee my safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.76,0:39:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.20,0:39:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你死了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you're killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.12,0:39:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那希望你有拍到那一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you get it on camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.84,0:39:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有为你做了些惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made you some surprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.12,0:39:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你会想要试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you wanna try one out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.44,0:39:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要加入凯妮斯的队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna be a part of Katniss' propo team, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.04,0:39:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要有一定的水准\N{\fnArial\fs30}you may as well look the part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.96,0:39:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this one is for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.32,0:39:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,普鲁塔克希望你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plutarch wanted you to have a weapon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.12,0:39:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,属于自己的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the sake of the propos{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.32,0:39:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我实在做不出来很时髦的来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I couldn't just make you a fashion accessory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.76,0:39:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.60,0:40:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.64,0:40:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,常规的 燃烧的 爆裂的三种弓箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regular. Incendiary. Explosive arrows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.24,0:40:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,都用颜色标记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All color-coded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.20,0:40:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 帮我跟芬尼克说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tell Finnick{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.68,0:40:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有为他准备三叉戟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a trident for him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.80,0:40:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he's ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.96,0:40:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量… 鼓励他一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might just cheer him… Cheer him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.76,0:40:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.84,0:40:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不可以使用红色的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not fire the red ones in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.32,0:40:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有这么多武器 却让其他的区孤军奋斗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had all of this and you just left the districts to fend for themselves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.56,0:40:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯 没这么简单 我们勉强撑了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that simple, Katniss. We barely survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.04,0:40:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们没有办法反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We weren't in any kind of shape to launch a counterattack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.36,0:40:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们可以轰炸都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we could've bombed the Capitol{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.68,0:41:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们至少会轰炸我们两次作为反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they would've retaliated with at least twice the firepower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.28,0:41:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.96,0:41:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便胜利了 也无人存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}There would've been nobody left to claim victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.76,0:41:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来就跟比德说的一样 但你们还说他是叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like exactly what Peeta said and then you all called him a traitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.40,0:41:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边请 士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.40,0:41:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真上镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are camera-ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.00,0:41:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得他很帅吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't your comrade look handsome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.00,0:41:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.72,0:41:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,平安归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.04,0:41:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单介绍一下 凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick introductions, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.52,0:41:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是远道而来参与这个计划的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people have come a long way to support the cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.96,0:41:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是 克瑞西达\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Cressida.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.08,0:41:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记忆中在都城里最棒的导演\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my opinion one of the best up-and-coming directors in the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.36,0:41:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是直到我离开之前啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I up and left. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.04,0:41:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.24,0:41:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看看你能做些什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what you can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.40,0:41:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.04,0:41:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的助手梅撒拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my assistant, Messalla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.12,0:41:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an honor to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.64,0:41:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄影师 卡斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your cameramen over there, Castor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.76,0:41:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.92,0:41:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有波勒克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Pollux.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.92,0:42:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,系好安全带吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get locked in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.44,0:42:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都来自都城吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all from the Capitol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.84,0:42:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,普鲁塔克去救你们出来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plutarch got you out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.12,0:42:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别期望他跟你聊天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't expect much chitchat from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.28,0:42:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有办法说话 几年前他被都城切去了舌头\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an Avox. Capitol cut his tongue out years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.12,0:42:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 没有你所谓的「救」出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, no, it wasn't any sort of rescue, if that's what you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.88,0:42:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人都出逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all fled on our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.12,0:42:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.92,0:42:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.88,0:43:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作要快 速战速决\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has gotta be fast. In and out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.20,0:43:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.36,0:43:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着 我们都不确定呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive then. We weren't sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.52,0:43:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯 这是第8区的指挥官 佩勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss, Commander Paylor, District 8.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.72,0:43:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯还在康复期间 但她坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss has been recovering, but she insisted on coming out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.52,0:43:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,探望受伤的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and seein' some of your wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.72,0:43:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多伤员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we've got plenty of those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.56,0:43:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在那里有一个万人坑 但 我没有多余的人力可以清理\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a mass grave a few blocks west, but, I can't spare the manpower to move them yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.12,0:44:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,医院在幕布后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hospital's past that curtain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.20,0:44:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你可以给他们希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any hope you can give them, it's worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.56,0:44:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城为了消灭我们无所不为\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Capitol's done everything they can to break us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.04,0:44:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不担心你的伤员都在同一个建筑物里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you worried about having all your wounded in one place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.40,0:44:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这样总比让他们自己等死好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's better than leaving them to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.96,0:44:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.24,0:44:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这其实也是我们唯一的选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's my only other option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.72,0:44:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有其它的办法 我也愿意听看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can come up with another, I'm all ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.00,0:44:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过去就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right through here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.04,0:44:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要在这里拍 我帮不了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't film me in there. I can't help them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.60,0:44:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让他们看到你的脸就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let them see your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.12,0:44:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.44,0:45:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.64,0:45:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Here, it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.20,0:45:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到你了 都没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got you. It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.52,0:45:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯·艾佛丁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss Everdeen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.44,0:45:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.68,0:45:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来看你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.56,0:45:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的孩子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.88,0:46:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我流产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.48,0:46:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在反抗吗 凯妮斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you fighting, Katniss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.84,0:46:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来和我们一起反抗的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You here to fight with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.64,0:46:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.64,0:46:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.08,0:46:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠近些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.04,0:46:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再靠近一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tighter, tighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.92,0:46:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些监控摄像头在轰炸之后损坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, some cameras were damaged in the bombings, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.88,0:46:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们确定就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we confirmed it's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.72,0:46:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,缩小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoom in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.76,0:47:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她那时正在前往一个临时医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was visiting a makeshift hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.96,0:47:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不确定她现在还在不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not sure if she's still there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.00,0:47:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.12,0:47:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以从11区派飞船去消灭他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can scramble hovercraft from the border of 11.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.76,0:47:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以锁定她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may be able to target her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.36,0:47:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.16,0:47:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀光那些伤员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.68,0:47:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.44,0:47:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己帮我写演讲稿吧 爱吉莉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wrote that speech yourself, Egeria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.00,0:47:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何有关嘲笑鸟的标识都是被禁止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any association with the Mockingjay symbol is forbidden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.20,0:47:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,医院里的所有人都违反了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone inside that hospital has committed treason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.92,0:47:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们看看与凯妮斯·艾佛丁为伍的代价吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show them what it costs to be friends with Katniss Everdeen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.84,0:47:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你妈看到视频 他会为你骄傲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom's gonna be proud of you when she sees the footage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.84,0:47:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会在每个区播放吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will this play in the districts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.40,0:47:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 会让他们印象深刻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be tattooed on their eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.40,0:47:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.32,0:47:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kinda problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.04,0:47:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有轰炸机从北边袭来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming bombers from the north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.28,0:47:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find cover now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.64,0:48:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有遮蔽物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bunker in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.64,0:48:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,直走到底下楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight ahead and down the stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.24,0:48:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.88,0:48:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.52,0:48:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾佛丁 艾佛丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everdeen! Everdeen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.60,0:48:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 离墙远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gale, back away from the wall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.16,0:48:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.08,0:48:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.68,0:49:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们追着什么东西去了南边\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going after something to the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.52,0:49:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们朝医院去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's towards the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.36,0:49:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要掉头回来了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're circling back around. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.68,0:49:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.24,0:49:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的目标是医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're targeting the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.32,0:50:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.40,0:50:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮他们逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help them! Get them out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.64,0:50:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.84,0:50:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以告诉大家你现在看到什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss, can you tell everyone what you're seeing right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.08,0:51:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss, what do you wanna say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.60,0:51:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让所有反叛者知道我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the rebels to know that I'm alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.04,0:51:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在在第8区\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I'm in District 8{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.16,0:51:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城刚刚轰炸了这里的医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the Capitol just bombed a hospital{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.32,0:51:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面手无寸铁的伤员 女人和小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}filled with unarmed men, women and children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.44,0:51:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人幸存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there will be no survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.40,0:51:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你以为都城会公平的对待我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think for one second that the Capitol will ever treat us fairly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.48,0:51:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你在自欺欺人罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are lying to yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.96,0:51:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们知道他们是怎么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we know who they are and what they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.12,0:51:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他们会做的事 我们一定要反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what they do! And we must fight back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.60,0:51:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一段话要给斯诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a message for President Snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.68,0:52:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以折磨我们 轰炸我们的区\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can torture us and bomb us and burn our districts to the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.00,0:52:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你看到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.04,0:52:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,火焰已被点燃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire is catching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.88,0:52:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们身处火海 那你也会葬身火海\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we burn, you burn with us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.88,0:52:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们知道他们是怎么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know who they are and what they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.68,0:52:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他们会做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what they do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.56,0:52:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定要反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we must fight back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.76,0:52:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以折磨我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can torture us and bomb us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.60,0:52:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,轰炸我们的区\N{\fnArial\fs30}and burn our districts to the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.92,0:52:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,普鲁塔克对你的信任没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plutarch's faith in you wasn't misplaced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.04,0:52:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你看到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.32,0:52:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.60,0:52:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,火焰已被点燃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire is catching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.84,0:52:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我一起奋斗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come up with me for the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.60,0:52:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们身处火海 那你也会葬身火海\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we burn, you burn with us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.20,0:53:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有妥协就没有进步\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no progress without compromise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.48,0:53:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有牺牲就没有胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}No victory without sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.24,0:53:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我如今我和嘲笑鸟站在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I stand here with The Mockingjay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.60,0:53:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣布 我们的时代已经到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to announce that our moment has arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.08,0:54:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,比堤已经把我们的广播讯号提高了10倍传输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beetee has increased our use of the airwaves tenfold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.16,0:54:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚会将这段视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will broadcast this message{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.88,0:54:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在各个区播放\N{\fnArial\fs30}to all the districts tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.32,0:54:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑鸟的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mockingjay's words{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.24,0:54:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,会激励所有人起来反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}inspiring everyone to join the rebellion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.36,0:54:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,团结一致 我们将会是坚不可摧的联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together, we will become an alliance to be reckoned with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.20,0:54:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,必胜 必胜 必胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoorah! Hoorah! Hoorah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.56,0:54:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不希望有这么多人参战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like hearing a fight song at a funeral, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.36,0:54:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们的人越多 比德和安妮就更有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more people on our side, the closer we are to Peeta and Annie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.84,0:54:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.08,0:55:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺总统下令\N{\fnArial\fs30}By order of President Snow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.36,0:55:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,日产量已增加\N{\fnArial\fs30}daily production quotas have been increased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.68,0:55:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有工作班次将会增加两个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}All work shifts will be extended by an extra two hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.00,0:55:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没做完不能休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Failure to meet these quotas will not be tolerated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.08,0:55:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺总统下令 日产量已增加\N{\fnArial\fs30}By order of President Snow daily production quotas have been increased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.92,0:56:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们身处火海 那你也会葬身火海\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we burn, you burn with us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.16,0:56:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有新的消息 - 什么消息？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got good news. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.12,0:56:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,科因同意让我们去地面打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coin agreed to let us hunt above ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.84,0:57:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至不害怕我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not even afraid of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.96,0:57:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为他们没有被猎捕过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 'cause they've never been hunted before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.56,0:57:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost not fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.84,0:59:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我们回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want us back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.40,0:59:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我们去大厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}They asked us to head for Command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.92,0:59:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 但先让我放一下东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I gotta drop these off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.36,0:59:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以说是我们最好的贡品\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was arguably our favorite Tribute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.36,0:59:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想最令人惊讶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think that's what we all find most astonishing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.48,0:59:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那女孩 曾经深受都城人民的爱戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that this girl was adored in the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.16,0:59:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我想起你 比德\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think for you, Peeta, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.96,0:59:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这一定很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}it must be particularly painful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.48,0:59:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我可以把这些玫瑰给你 凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could give this rose to you, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.96,0:59:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变了好多 他们对他做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's changed so much already. What are they doing to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.36,1:00:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份贴心的礼物 送给一个燃起战火的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sweet gesture for a girl who has inspired such violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.52,1:00:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定很爱她 所以你才会原谅她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must love her very much to be able to forgive her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.12,1:00:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在颤抖吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's shaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.20,1:00:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我忍不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that I could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.68,1:00:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 比德 会不会凯妮斯是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless, of course, Peeta, you think that perhaps she's being{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.16,1:00:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,被迫说出\N{\fnArial\fs30}forced into saying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.76,1:00:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些她甚至都不明白的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}things that she doesn't even understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.16,1:00:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's exactly what I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.76,1:00:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,连声音都不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even his voice is different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.12,1:00:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们是要用这招击溃反叛军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're using her to whip up the rebels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.96,1:00:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑你知道这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt she even knows what's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.36,1:00:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's really at stake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.08,1:00:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德 我想叛军不会让她看这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Peeta, I doubt that the rebels will ever let her see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.60,1:00:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果她看到了 你想和她说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if they do, what would you say to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.52,1:00:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你最爱的凯妮斯·艾佛丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Katniss Everdeen, the once sweet Katniss Everdeen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.00,1:00:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉她… 多为自己想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would tell her to think for herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.68,1:00:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.32,1:00:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了 凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a fool, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.16,1:00:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不希望反抗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you never wanted the rebellion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.56,1:00:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏中你做的那些 绝不是有意要反叛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things that you did in the Games were never intended to start all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.20,1:01:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,反叛军把你搞得不像你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rebels have made you into something that you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.76,1:01:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你搞成毁灭我们的机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that could destroy all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.08,1:01:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还有能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you have any power or any say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.92,1:01:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以拒绝他们利用你 或者撼动他们的决议\N{\fnArial\fs30}in what they do or how they use you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.04,1:01:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请求 请求 要他们停止战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}please, please, urge them to stop this war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.60,1:01:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一切都来不及之前停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.64,1:01:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后问问你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ask yourself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.44,1:01:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能相信现在和你共事的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you trust the people you're working with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.24,1:01:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你知道他们真正要的是什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what they really want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.00,1:01:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须作出回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to respond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.24,1:01:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 比德·梅尔拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Peeta Mellark, for these{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.16,1:01:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们分享这段和嘲笑鸟有关的访问\N{\fnArial\fs30}revelations about the real Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.56,1:01:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他怎么了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see what he looks like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.32,1:01:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到一个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a coward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.60,1:01:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道他都遭受过了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have any idea what he's going through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.32,1:01:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不在乎 我都不会说出他刚刚说的那种话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care. I would never say what he just said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.04,1:01:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是不是有一把枪顶着我的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if they tortured me. Not with a gun to my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.60,1:01:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和当初帮助你躲避鞭刑的比德是同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the same Peeta that defended you at the whipping post.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.68,1:01:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 已经不是了 现在他只会为了自己做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not. Now he's only defending himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.68,1:01:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统要我们去开会 我们要做出回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coin's called a meeting. We need to respond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.68,1:01:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候你和总统变成「你们」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did "we" become you and Coin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.28,1:01:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone has a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.12,1:02:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么可以坐在都城帮助那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can he sit there in the Capitol and defend the people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.48,1:02:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁了他的家园的人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}who destroyed his home and murdered his family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.68,1:02:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.16,1:02:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么可能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.76,1:02:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人知道都城对12区做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's seen what the Capitol did to 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.04,1:02:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得让他们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to show them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.84,1:02:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我们从正义楼开始拍摄 可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I wanna start with you in front of the Justice Building, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.52,1:02:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bang. First shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.80,1:02:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯 告诉我们这里怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss, tell us what happened here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.40,1:02:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经都站在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all standin' right here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.12,1:03:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你在游戏中向天空射出那一箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}watchin' the Games when you fired that arrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.92,1:03:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然间荧幕黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The screens just went dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.08,1:03:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人知道怎么一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody had any idea what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.36,1:03:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,治安官要我们各自回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peacekeepers forced us back into our homes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.80,1:03:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小时之后整个城镇一片死寂\N{\fnArial\fs30}For maybe an hour, the town was just dead quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.72,1:03:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,9点后 我们看到卡车都撤出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little past 9:00, we heard their trucks pullin' out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.24,1:03:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个治安官都离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them. Every single Peacekeeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.20,1:03:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道这代表什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I knew what that meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.24,1:03:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和矿场里的几个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and a couple of guys from the mines, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.68,1:03:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始把大家拉出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we started pulling people from their houses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.56,1:03:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望可以逃出轰炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tried to get 'em to the fence line{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.48,1:03:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有些人害怕夜晚的森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a lotta people were scared of the forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.48,1:03:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们转向大路去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they headed up onto the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.76,1:03:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许就是那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a break for it that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.92,1:04:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with Gale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.08,1:04:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,915个人逃到了栅栏那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}915 of us made it to the fence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.52,1:04:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 轰炸机到了大路那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we watched as bombers circled back towards the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.52,1:04:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把他们炸死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They firebombed them as they ran away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.76,1:04:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,1万人中只有915个活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}915 outta 10, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.24,1:04:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该拉着他们跟我走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've grabbed people. I should've dragged 'em with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.40,1:04:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还可多带几个小孩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the kids I could've carried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.92,1:04:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经救了很多人了 盖尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved so many people, Gale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.64,1:05:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你 就没有12区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without you, there would be no District 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.84,1:05:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至回忆也没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even the memory of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.52,1:05:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你吻我的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where you kissed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.36,1:05:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你应该不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think you remembered that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.96,1:05:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我死 才会忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have to be dead to forget that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.96,1:05:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许死也不会忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not even then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.04,1:06:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.92,1:06:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.72,1:06:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm in pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.08,1:06:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我引起你的注意的唯一办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only way that I can get your attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.28,1:06:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 这些都会过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Katniss. It'll pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.28,1:06:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.40,1:07:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有一只嘲笑鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's a mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.80,1:07:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在会叫个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now they'll never shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.32,1:07:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想唱首歌吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to sing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.88,1:07:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否 是否 来此树下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you, are you comin' to the tree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.72,1:07:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,男子吊死之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where they strung up a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.36,1:07:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谣传三人为他所诛\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say who murdered three{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.28,1:07:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,吊诡之事接连而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange things did happen here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.92,1:07:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,诡异无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stranger would it be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.36,1:08:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当我们午夜相会于此吊人树\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we met at midnight in the hanging tree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.04,1:08:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否 是否 来此树下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you, are you comin' to the tree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.48,1:08:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,死去的人呼唤着他的爱人 一起私奔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where a dead man called out for his love to flee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.12,1:08:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,吊诡之事接连而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange things did happen here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.68,1:08:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,诡异无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stranger would it be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.36,1:08:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当我们午夜相会于此吊人树\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we met at midnight in the hanging tree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.04,1:08:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否 是否 来此树下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you, are you comin' to the tree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.36,1:08:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉过你要逃离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I told you to run so we'd both be free{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.77,1:08:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯此你我才能自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we'd both be free{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.04,1:08:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,吊诡之事接连而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange things did happen here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.64,1:08:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,诡异无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stranger would it be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.20,1:08:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当我们午夜相会于此吊人树\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we met at midnight in the hanging tree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.38,1:08:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,于此吊人树\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the hanging tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.72,1:08:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否 是否 来此树下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you, are you comin' to the tree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.40,1:08:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上希望的锁链 与我吊在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wear a necklace of hope side by side with me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.64,1:08:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,原本的歌词是「绳做的项链」\N{\fnArial\fs30}That line was originally "necklace of rope."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.96,1:09:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它改成「希望的项链」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had it changed to "necklace of hope."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.56,1:09:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 你真是厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. You are a true wordsmith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.56,1:09:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小意思 当然 战争就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little on the nose, but, of course, so is war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.88,1:09:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有区域都看的到这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every district's seeing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.80,1:09:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了都城以外都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. But not the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.00,1:09:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初是我为他们设计这套防御系统的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I designed this signal defense system for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.08,1:09:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果我自己竟然不会破解\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't find my way through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.40,1:09:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是我把我的工作做得太完美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I did my job too well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.96,1:09:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个时候 当时我满脑子是科学研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the time, I was just thinking of the science of it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.56,1:09:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以黑进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.00,1:09:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否 是否 来此树下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you, are you comin' to the tree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.92,1:09:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,男子吊死之处谣传三人为他所诛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where they strung up a man they say who murdered three{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.68,1:09:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,吊诡之事接连而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange things did happen here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.92,1:09:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,诡异无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stranger would it be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.28,1:09:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当我们午夜相会于此吊人树\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we met at midnight in the hanging tree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.20,1:09:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否 是否 来此树下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you, are you comin' to the tree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.12,1:09:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,死去的人呼唤着他的爱人 一起私奔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where a dead man called out for his love to flee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.08,1:09:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,吊诡之事接连而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange things did happen here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.16,1:09:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,诡异无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stranger would it be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.56,1:10:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当我们午夜相会于此吊人树\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we met at midnight in the hanging tree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.56,1:12:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进 还有反向前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moves and countermoves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.68,1:12:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯 总统在控制室要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss, you're wanted in Command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.96,1:12:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收到报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, we've received reports{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.24,1:12:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚有火车出轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}of derailed trains, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.40,1:12:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,粮仓被烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}of granaries on fire, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.00,1:12:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人攻击了第5区的发电所\N{\fnArial\fs30}and of a savage attack on the hydroelectric dam in District 5.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.76,1:12:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对你了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what have they done to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.60,1:12:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直呼吁理性和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging for restraint and decency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.76,1:12:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们入侵他们的信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We interrupt your regularly scheduled horse manure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.68,1:12:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.96,1:13:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来此树下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comin' to the tree?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.16,1:13:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 我们的视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. That's our footage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.48,1:13:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,比堤进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beetee's in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.96,1:13:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谣传三人为他所诛\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say who murdered three{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.24,1:13:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.40,1:13:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看到了 他看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sees it. He sees our propo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.24,1:13:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,诡异无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stranger would it be… {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.72,1:13:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯 是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss, are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.96,1:13:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.72,1:13:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.76,1:13:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德 请继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta, please continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.64,1:13:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚谈到那些野蛮的袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were telling us about these savage attacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.60,1:13:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.12,1:13:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些在发电所的冲突是冷酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}The attack on the dam was a callous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.84,1:13:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不人道的破坏性行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}and inhuman act of destruction…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.56,1:13:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,死去的人呼唤着他的爱人 一起私奔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where a dead man called out for his love to flee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.48,1:13:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,试想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.84,1:13:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会如何结束 结束之后又能剩下些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will this end? What Will be left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.36,1:14:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有可以活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can survive this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.52,1:14:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is safe now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.20,1:14:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在都城也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here in the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.36,1:14:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在任何区也没有人是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in any of the districts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.36,1:14:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯 他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.56,1:14:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要杀光13区所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna kill everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.04,1:14:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天早上13区将会惨不忍睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in District 13 you'll be dead by morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.12,1:14:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在警告我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's warning us. That was a warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.88,1:14:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.92,1:14:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得在他们杀了他之前救他出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get him out before they kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.44,1:14:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前空中有什么威胁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything in the air?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.60,1:14:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷达上没有目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing on Doppler, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.00,1:14:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直都在都城 或许可以偷听到些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in the mansion. He could have overheard something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.96,1:14:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.48,1:14:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候空袭演习了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for an air raid drill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.72,1:14:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是红色警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a code red alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.72,1:14:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, remain calm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.24,1:14:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}and begin evacuation protocol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.00,1:14:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,普里姆 普里姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prim! Prim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.92,1:14:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽速到达你最近的避难区 并下至40层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed to your nearest stairwell and descend to level 40.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.40,1:15:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全门将会在6分钟后关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast doors will be sealed in six minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.52,1:15:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是红色警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a code red alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.72,1:15:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保持冷静 开始疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, remain calm and begin evacuation protocol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.72,1:15:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,请有秩序的到达你最近的避难区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed in an orderly fashion to your nearest stairwell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.80,1:15:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,并下至40层\N{\fnArial\fs30}and descend to level 40.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.28,1:15:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.60,1:15:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城的三个中队刚刚入侵了我们的领空\N{\fnArial\fs30}three Capitol squadrons just entered our airspace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.12,1:15:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有多久时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much time do we have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.60,1:15:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下几秒了进入射程\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a few seconds from range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.60,1:15:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to scramble the fleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.04,1:15:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.12,1:15:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开所有防御系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up short-range air defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.80,1:15:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备远程导弹反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arm long-range missiles for counterattack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.76,1:15:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全门将会在5分钟后关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast doors will be sealed in five minutes.{\r}
