Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.52,1:16:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,请尽速去供应站提领物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue to the Supply Station and claim one pack{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.68,1:16:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个成员都要拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}for each member of your compartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.44,1:16:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,请将所有个人物品放置在自己的区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please keep all personal items within your assigned area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.68,1:16:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼让同胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be courteous to your fellow citizens.{\r}
