Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.56,1:17:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人应当到避难所避难\N{\fnArial\fs30}All citizens should be inside the bunker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.12,1:17:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安全门2分钟后关闭 - 妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Blast doors will close in two minutes. - Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.20,1:17:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,普里姆在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Prim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.28,1:17:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为她去找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought she went to find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.04,1:17:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定还在楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must still be on the stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.44,1:17:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼梯上没有人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one on the stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.76,1:17:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回去找猫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She went back for the cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.08,1:17:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是红色警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a code red alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.36,1:17:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人应当到避难所避难\N{\fnArial\fs30}All citizens should be inside the bunker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.72,1:17:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 站住 站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.80,1:17:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全门将在1分钟后关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast doors will close in one minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.40,1:17:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们轰炸了西北部四分之一地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hit the far edge of the northwest quadrant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.04,1:17:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿透地下12米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penetrated 40 feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.44,1:17:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有击中居住区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missed the living quarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.64,1:17:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有第2 3走廊受损\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only minor damage to corridors 2 and 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.80,1:17:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有辐射外泄吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any radiation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.12,1:17:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有侦测到\N{\fnArial\fs30}None detected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.20,1:17:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷达显示第4波攻击到达了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doppler shows a fourth wave approaching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.08,1:17:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全门将在30秒后关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast doors will close in 30 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.20,1:17:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,普里姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.64,1:17:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,普里姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.76,1:17:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.04,1:18:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是红色警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a code red alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.68,1:18:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.84,1:18:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全门将在15秒后关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast doors will close in 15 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.44,1:18:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.00,1:18:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 - 这是红色警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry! - This is a code red alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.20,1:18:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全门将在10秒后关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast doors will close in 10 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.00,1:18:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 5 - 别关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Five… - Hold the doors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.56,1:18:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 2 - 等等 先别关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two… - Wait! Hold the doors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.88,1:18:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑回去找猫？你到底在想什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went back for the cat? What were you thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.28,1:18:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能把它留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't gonna leave him behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.08,1:18:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有它我活不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't live with myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.32,1:18:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全门已封闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast doors are now sealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.48,1:18:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 普里姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Prim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.16,1:18:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.56,1:19:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经攻击到西北部的含水层了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damage to the aquifer in the northwest quadrant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.56,1:19:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经失去至少一个交通走廊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost a transport corridor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.24,1:19:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,西北区将再也没有东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing else in the northwest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.00,1:19:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们地对空的武器刚刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our surface-to-air launchers just took{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.52,1:19:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷达3区被攻击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a direct hit in sector 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.48,1:19:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们暴露自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we revealed ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.16,1:19:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发现了我们开火位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}They saw us firing there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.56,1:19:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,取消 不启动舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down. Don't launch the fleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.52,1:19:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有都城12架轰炸机到了 第3区已经被锁定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another 12 Capitol bombers approaching sector 3 in attack formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.08,1:19:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们接近不要开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold fire on their approach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.80,1:19:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.64,1:19:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们击中了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd they hit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.72,1:19:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块岩石 有杂物在通风管道中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bedrock. But there's debris in the ventilation shaft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.08,1:19:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道我们的设备位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not targeting our fleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.60,1:19:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不清楚我们特殊武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or our Special Weaponry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.88,1:19:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道我们有什么 或者放在何处\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know what we have or where we have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.40,1:19:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以确定所有人都已经到达避难所了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you confirm that everyone's safely in the bunker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.48,1:19:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.44,1:19:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐藏所有其他防空炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conceal all remaining anti-aircraft guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.20,1:19:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭发射平台和通风走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal launching pads and ventilation corridors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.00,1:19:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要度过这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are gonna wait this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.88,1:19:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们在地下的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what we're built for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.48,1:19:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们锁定了这里就像一座坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll seal us in here like a tomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.04,1:19:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,都成没有任何最新的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Capitol's working off some outdated information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.84,1:19:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想帮他们更新资讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather not update it for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.52,1:19:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统阁下 这不是我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President, I know it's not my place…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.72,1:20:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你是贵宾 但不要管的太深\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not. You're a welcome guest, but you're out of your depth down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.16,1:20:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,减少14％的氧气 用于长期供应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reduce oxygen to 14% to conserve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.96,1:20:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.04,1:20:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,深呼吸 黑文斯比先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a deep breath, Mr. Heavensbee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.04,1:20:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会是漫长的一晚啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a long night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.36,1:20:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,普里姆 跟我说说什么事吧 说什么都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prim, talk about something. Anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.52,1:20:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要提拔我去医院帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}They promoted me at the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.60,1:21:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘记告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.20,1:21:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要训练我当医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're training me to be a doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.84,1:21:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不这么做才是白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd be stupid not to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.20,1:22:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.56,1:22:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可坐下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I sit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.84,1:22:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.40,1:22:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺用安妮逞罚你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snow's using Annie to punish you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.24,1:22:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,用他们来嘲笑我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taunting us with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.84,1:22:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直不懂 直到我刚刚看到了那只蠢猫抓影子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't understand until just now watching that stupid cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.52,1:22:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你第一场饥饿游戏之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After your first Games, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.28,1:22:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为那场恋爱只是演戏罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the whole romance was an act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.72,1:23:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都希望你继续这样演下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all expected you to continue that strategy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.04,1:23:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当比德心脏停止时 快要死掉时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wasn't until Peeta's heart stopped and he nearly died that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.52,1:23:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我看错你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I'd misjudged you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.60,1:23:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你深爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.24,1:23:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying in what way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.44,1:23:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你自己也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you don't even know yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.40,1:23:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但任何有在专心看的人都看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But anyone paying attention can see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.24,1:23:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你整么撑过来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you live with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.28,1:23:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我整晚噩梦侵袭 无法解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drag myself outta nightmares and there's no relief in waking up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.92,1:23:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 不要自暴自弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's better not to give in to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.96,1:23:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得振作起来 比起让自己崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes 10 times longer to put yourself back together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.40,1:23:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要难上10倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}than it does to fall apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.56,1:23:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯 凯妮斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss? Katniss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.56,1:23:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.48,1:24:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们撑过了他们的攻击 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took their best shot. Didn't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.32,1:24:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.16,1:24:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家人还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother and sister okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.00,1:24:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they're fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.40,1:24:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮我们做一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to do something for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.28,1:24:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要告诉施惠国的所有人 我们撑住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to tell Panem that we survived an attack by the Capitol{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.12,1:24:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且完好无损\N{\fnArial\fs30}with no casualties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.16,1:24:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们仍然可以全面运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we remain fully operational.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.48,1:24:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.40,1:24:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有件事情必须要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.76,1:24:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们多了8分钟 可以撤离民众\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had eight extra minutes of civilian evacuation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.56,1:24:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为比德的警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of Peeta's warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.20,1:24:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会忘记的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't forget that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.16,1:24:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.76,1:24:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Katniss, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.36,1:24:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「13区完好无损 我也一样」\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's "13 is alive and well and so am I."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.44,1:25:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.68,1:25:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.00,1:25:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道没有人喜欢排练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never one to waste it in rehearsal, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.08,1:26:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么扔下这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they drop these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.36,1:26:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是针对我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.92,1:26:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 凯妮斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to go, Katniss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.08,1:26:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得像在第8区那样 开始拍摄\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna do this, just like District 8.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.56,1:26:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我有关玫瑰的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about the roses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.60,1:26:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉斯诺 13区完好无损 我也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Snow 13 is alive and well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.44,1:26:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会杀了比德的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.92,1:26:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再来一次 你得说大声一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try again. Can you speak up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.24,1:26:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没给你麦克风\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a mic on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.80,1:26:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,「13区完好无损 我也一样」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"13 is alive and well and so am l."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.92,1:26:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会杀了比德的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna kill Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.80,1:27:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.84,1:27:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.76,1:27:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的 凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do it, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.28,1:27:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.44,1:27:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「13区完好无损 我也一样」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"13 is alive and well and so am l."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.80,1:27:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会继续…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just gonna keep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.56,1:27:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never gonna stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.84,1:27:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,克瑞西达 先停止吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cressida, we should cut the cameras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.16,1:27:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只要我还是嘲笑鸟 - 没事的 凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …as long as I'm The Mockingjay. - It's okay, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.60,1:27:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他警告我了 提醒我这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He warned me. He warned me about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.16,1:27:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这么做是因为我是嘲笑鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's doing this because I'm The Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.08,1:27:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用惩罚比德来惩罚我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's punishing Peeta to punish me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.68,1:27:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.40,1:27:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.96,1:27:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.00,1:27:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me do this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.32,1:27:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.60,1:27:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.00,1:28:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 就这样结束？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is the end, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.96,1:28:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想永远躲在这下面吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I s'pose you're just gonna hide down here forever?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.48,1:28:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再当嘲笑鸟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be The Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.36,1:28:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不当嘲笑鸟 当凯妮斯就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not The Mockingjay. Just Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.04,1:28:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 你是我在这下面唯一的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're the only real friend I have down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.12,1:28:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不希望他们给你下药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose they gave you any kind of medication?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.80,1:28:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're unbelievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.96,1:28:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但我说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but I meant what I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.20,1:28:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我在这里就是让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the reason I'm here is to let you know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.24,1:28:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也在救比德\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're rescuing Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.36,1:28:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.48,1:28:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,第5区的电厂坏了 断绝了给都城的大部分电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dam went down in District 5, took out most of the power to the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.20,1:28:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,防御系统失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knocked out their signal defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.24,1:28:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,比堤正在对系统进行破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beetee's inside their system now, wreaking all kinds of havoc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.04,1:28:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到一个漏洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}A window is open to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.36,1:28:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不知道他能维持多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer? I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.64,1:28:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概等都城回复电力就不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess until the Capitol can get the power back on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.36,1:28:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统科因？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And President Coin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.68,1:28:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我不会永远支持这个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I can never fully support that woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.80,1:29:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她这里有禁酒令…\N{\fnArial\fs30}in light of the prohibition they have going on around this place, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.96,1:29:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但… 普鲁塔克收到情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Plutarch got word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.68,1:29:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德和其他人都被关在贡品中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Peeta and the others are in the Tribute Center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.44,1:29:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上电力消失 总统认为这是一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with the power out, Coin sees this as an opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.88,1:29:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道比德\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knows that Peeta{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.60,1:29:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是都城的武器 就像你是我们的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the Capitol's weapon. The same way you're ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.08,1:29:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对对方都具有影响力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as opposed to having you two pointing at each other, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.04,1:29:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要去救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's going to get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.44,1:29:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须去帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.60,1:29:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 孩子 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, whoa, kiddo. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.92,1:29:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 干什么 你不会想要直接跑去都城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. What, are you just gonna jump outta the vent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.96,1:29:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,送死吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go storm the Capitol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.32,1:29:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,除此之外 行动已经开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, it's already underway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.28,1:29:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,6个士兵志愿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six soldiers went in. Volunteer only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.64,1:29:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜谁是第一个勇敢报名的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And guess who was the first brave soul to sign up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.80,1:29:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.76,1:29:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 芬尼克？- 对 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, Finnick? - Yeah. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.96,1:29:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,站到中间 站到石头上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go in the center there. Those rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.48,1:30:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡斯特 去左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castor, to left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.72,1:30:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,波勒克斯 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pollux, you're with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.68,1:30:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们直接对着镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we'll go straight to camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.92,1:30:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗 芬尼克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Finnick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.44,1:30:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.92,1:30:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.68,1:30:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.28,1:30:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得要一直说话 不要停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just remember to keep talking and don't stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.64,1:30:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是芬尼克·奥迪尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Finnick Odair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.76,1:30:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,第65届饥饿游戏的胜利者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winner of the 65th Hunger Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.80,1:30:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你 13区活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm coming to you from District 13, alive and well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.52,1:30:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们撑过都城的攻击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've survived an assault from the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.72,1:30:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不是来给你报导最新的新闻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not here to give you recent news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.56,1:30:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么芬尼克在录影？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is Finnick doing a propo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.72,1:30:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你们更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lot more than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.36,1:30:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,比堤控制了系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beetee's commandeered the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.40,1:30:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在用的发电机功率不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that they're down to generator power{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.32,1:30:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有这么高的频率控制系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a more limited range of frequencies available to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.48,1:30:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要用芬尼克的视频占用全部的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm filling them all up with Finnick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.52,1:30:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不会有很多人会看到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not many will see it, but whoever does{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.20,1:30:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们相信这是另一个短片\N{\fnArial\fs30}will think it's another propo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.56,1:30:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What they don't know is this broadcast{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.20,1:30:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的传输系统已完全被干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}is jamming their entire system with noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.00,1:30:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的早期预警 内部通信 搞趴下所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Early defense warning, internal communications, everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.36,1:31:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要视频继续播放\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as the broadcast goes through, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.88,1:31:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的营救小组 就可以神不知鬼不觉的出入\N{\fnArial\fs30}our team should be able to get in and out undetected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.52,1:31:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相不是奢华生活的神话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth. Not the myths about a life of luxury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.56,1:31:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是荣耀祖国的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the lie about glory for your homeland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.84,1:31:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在竞技场活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can survive the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.28,1:31:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你存活下来的那一刻 你就是永远的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moment you leave, you're a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.92,1:31:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑鸟1 嘲笑鸟1\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mockingjay One, Mockingjay One, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.04,1:31:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还有1分钟进入敌方外线防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are one minute out from perimeter defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.32,1:31:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,关灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.64,1:31:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,启用低空飞行系统 保持连线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay low in case they're online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.00,1:31:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺总统曾经出售我的精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}President Snow used to sell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.72,1:31:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肉体 至少 我不是唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or my body, at least. I wasn't the only one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.88,1:31:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果胜利者者被认为是招人喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a Victor is considered desirable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.36,1:31:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统把它作为奖励 出售他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}the President gives them as a reward or allows people to buy them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.68,1:31:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果拒绝 他就杀死你心爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you refuse, he kills someone you love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.80,1:31:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑鸟1 你们还有20秒进入敌方外线防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mockingjay One, you are 20 seconds from perimeter defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.04,1:32:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,外线防线没有反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}No response from perimeter defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.76,1:32:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进入都城领空\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're inside Capitol airspace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.44,1:32:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了减轻愧疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make themselves feel better, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.08,1:32:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的主顾会给我钱或珠宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}my patrons would make presents of money or jewelry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.96,1:32:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我发现了比这都还重要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I found a much more valuable form of payment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.80,1:32:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.00,1:32:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gear up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.00,1:32:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,开启夜视镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switching 110 Night View.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.96,1:33:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.16,1:33:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官 我们可以看到贡品中心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command, we have visual on the Tribute Center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.84,1:33:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiating final approach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.48,1:33:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴上面罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Masks on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.08,1:33:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到的是堕落 谎言和残暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I know all the depravity, the deceit and the cruelty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.68,1:33:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,娇生惯养的都城精英\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Capitol's pampered elite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.04,1:33:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有个关于科利奥兰纳斯·斯诺总统的大秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the biggest secrets are about our good President, Coriolanus Snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.20,1:33:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.16,1:33:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官 我是队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command, this is Team Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.60,1:34:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备释放气体 我们要确认进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to deploy gas. We will confirm once inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.52,1:34:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此一个年轻人爬到顶峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a young man when he rose to power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.28,1:34:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,并聪明地维护权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a clever one to keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.92,1:34:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会想 他是怎么做到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How, you may ask, did he do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.08,1:34:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}One word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.32,1:34:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.04,1:34:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready to drop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.08,1:34:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他每次把叛乱扼杀在摇篮\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stopped every mutiny before it even started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.88,1:35:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.64,1:35:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全 指挥官 我们进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear. Command, we're inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.00,1:35:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,向一号目标前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heading toward target number one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.08,1:35:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,2C下层 P45房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cell P45 lower level 2C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.84,1:35:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.40,1:35:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有许多反对者神秘的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are so many mysterious deaths to adversaries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.20,1:35:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至连盟友都被怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even to allies who were threats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.88,1:35:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺为了避免引起猜疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snow would drink from the same cup, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.40,1:35:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就从同一个毒杯子喝水\N{\fnArial\fs30}to deflect suspicion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.68,1:35:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但解毒剂不是都有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}But antidotes don't always work, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.84,1:35:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用气味重的玫瑰\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why he wears roses that reek of perfume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.04,1:35:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了掩盖他腐烂 满嘴的血腥味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help cover the scent of blood from sores in his mouth that will never heal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.52,1:36:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.88,1:36:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但毕竟是无法掩盖他真实的自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he can't hide the scent of who he really is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.52,1:36:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个无情的侩子手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kills without mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.56,1:36:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,用欺骗和恐吓手段统治着人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He rules with deception and fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.68,1:37:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一种武器适合他这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}His weapon of choice is the only thing suited to such a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.36,1:37:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.40,1:37:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,属于蛇的完美武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The perfect weapon for a snake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.12,1:37:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.48,1:37:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比堤？- 我失去信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beetee? - I'm losing them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.16,1:37:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,电力回复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powering back up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.64,1:37:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,都城的防御系统回复了 正在重启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, the Capitol air defense system is rebooting. It's coming back online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.36,1:37:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定从哪里得到了电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be diverting power from another source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.20,1:37:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待传输\N{\fnArial\fs30}And filtering transmissions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.36,1:37:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在60秒后 我们就会被切断信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another 60 seconds and we'll be cut off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.92,1:37:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统 我们要叫回飞船吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President, should we call back the hovercraft?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.96,1:37:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,传送给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broadcast me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.76,1:37:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果斯诺在看 他会让信号传输进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Snow's watching this, maybe he'll let the signal in, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.80,1:37:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他看到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he sees me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.00,1:37:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我传上去吧 让他来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put me on the air so he can see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.76,1:37:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.28,1:37:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put her on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.48,1:37:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以做什么 我们可以发送吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we do this? Can we still get in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.96,1:37:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 现在还可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. For the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.12,1:37:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅开放见到你的线路\N{\fnArial\fs30}The line's open. He will only see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.60,1:37:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯妮斯 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Katniss, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.56,1:37:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺总统？\N{\fnArial\fs30}President Snow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.72,1:37:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺总统 我是凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}President Snow. It's Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.64,1:38:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不一定在看\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no guarantee he's even watching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.36,1:38:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 或许他在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but he might be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.08,1:38:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺总统 我有话要对你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}President Snow, I need to speak with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.16,1:38:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在听吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.64,1:38:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺总统 我是凯妮斯 你听的到我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}President Snow, it's Katniss. Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.76,1:38:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to speak with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.36,1:38:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺总统 我是凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}President Snow, it's Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.52,1:38:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}President Snow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.48,1:38:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在听吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.84,1:38:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在听到我了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.12,1:38:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}President Snow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.20,1:38:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾佛丁小姐 荣幸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Everdeen. What an honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.64,1:38:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢想像你要打电话来 谢谢我送你玫瑰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't imagine you're calling to thank me for the roses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.84,1:38:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有说我要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never asked for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.68,1:38:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没有说过我要参加游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never asked to be in the Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.80,1:38:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯格斯？收到了吗 伯格斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boggs? Come in. Boggs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.48,1:38:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不曾要求成为嘲笑鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never asked to be The Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.52,1:38:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想要救我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanted to save my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.84,1:38:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,和比德\N{\fnArial\fs30}And keep Peeta alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.56,1:38:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了吗 伯格斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in. Boggs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.68,1:39:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 放他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.80,1:39:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会在当嘲笑鸟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will stop being The Mockingjay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.32,1:39:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不想见我 我也可以消失的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will disappear. You will never have to see me ever again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.92,1:39:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾佛丁小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Everdeen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.68,1:39:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯格斯 收到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boggs, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.88,1:39:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法逃避这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't run from this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.36,1:39:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.48,1:39:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你永远无法从游戏中逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…any more than you could have run from the Games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.84,1:39:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官 我需要知道目前的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command, I need a situation report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.04,1:39:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯格斯 我们快要没有时间了 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boggs, we're running out of time. Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.20,1:39:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.44,1:39:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.76,1:39:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.68,1:39:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经打倒我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've already beaten me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.52,1:39:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,放走比德吧 由我代替他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release Peeta. And take me instead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.44,1:39:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're long past the opportunity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.34,1:39:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}for noble sacrifice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.84,1:39:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你告诉我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then tell me what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.68,1:39:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是一直都谨守诺言吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always kept my promises, haven't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.80,1:39:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你不想要有战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you didn't want a war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.92,1:39:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它还是发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's just what's happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.24,1:39:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经告诉过你「和平」是多么脆弱的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you what a fragile thing peace was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.44,1:40:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 还是像个孩子 你乐于打破和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}And still, like a child, you took pleasure in breaking it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.40,1:40:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是怎样一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.60,1:40:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会目光短浅 做事任性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can't see past your narrowest concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.32,1:40:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 艾佛丁小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}But please, Miss Everdeen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.44,1:40:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑你知不知道「诚实」是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt you know what honesty is anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.28,1:40:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到第一目标这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command, we're at the first target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.92,1:40:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备营救比德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preparing to extract Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.44,1:40:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要确定一下他是否还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will confirm when he's in hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.88,1:40:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑鸟1 准备飞船撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mockingjay One, prepare hovercraft for evac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.20,1:40:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我说服你我爱比德\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me to convince you that I was in love with Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.44,1:40:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后还不是做到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't I at least done that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.24,1:40:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾佛丁小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Everdeen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.72,1:40:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些我们最爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's the things we love most{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.60,1:40:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,往往会毁了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}that destroy us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.12,1:40:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你记得我说过这句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to remember that I said that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.80,1:40:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会以为我不知道你朋友在贡品中心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think I know your friends are in the Tribute Center?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.64,1:40:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut them off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.24,1:41:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 伯格斯 请回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Boggs, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.96,1:41:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.12,1:41:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯格斯 请回话 你听的到我说话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boggs, come in. Do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.56,1:41:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道他们在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows that they're in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.88,1:41:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是陷阱 - 凯妮斯 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a trap. - Katniss, hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.48,1:41:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get a hold of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.68,1:41:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要告诉他们 斯诺知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to tell them to get out. He knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.32,1:41:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有信号了 我们连络不到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no signal. We can't contact them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.64,1:41:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 黑密契 他一直知道 他故意要折磨我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Haymitch, he knew the whole time. He was taunting me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.28,1:41:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 黑密契 他知道他们在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Haymitch. They're in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.60,1:41:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we don't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.88,1:41:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚就要失去他们两个了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I lose them both tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.76,1:41:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我今晚就要失去他们两个了？- 嘘嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did I lose them both tonight? - Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.16,1:41:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚就要失去他们两个了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I lose them? I lost them both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.80,1:41:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.44,1:41:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.92,1:41:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.36,1:41:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是这世界最煎熬的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the worst torture in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.84,1:41:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待 因为你知道自己无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting, when you know there's nothing you can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.36,1:42:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是像我们这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially for people like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.68,1:42:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不管是坚强 勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whatever strength, courage, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.96,1:42:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}madness, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.48,1:42:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让我们继续前进 尤其在这样的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeps us going, you find it, at times like these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.04,1:42:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的 士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have it, soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.40,1:42:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是让你活到现在的动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what's kept you alive all this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.48,1:42:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且它永远打不倒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it won't fail you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.76,1:42:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.56,1:43:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.76,1:43:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johanna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.28,1:43:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finnick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.00,1:43:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finnick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.40,1:43:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie? Annie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.00,1:43:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你安全了 你安全了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're safe. You're safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.48,1:43:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gale!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.12,1:43:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.92,1:43:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？发生什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.28,1:43:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.68,1:43:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的武器都联机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every gun was back online{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.28,1:43:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对着我们 而我们却飞过他们的防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}and on us and we flew right past them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.32,1:43:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们放了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They let us go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.16,1:43:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.64,1:43:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的警卫用了瓦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas we used on the guards{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.80,1:43:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也把他弄昏了 但他现在醒来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}knocked him out, too, but it's wearing off now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.32,1:44:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他醒来时 你应该要在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be there when he wakes up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.32,1:44:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.88,1:44:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.36,1:44:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.68,1:45:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.56,1:45:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德 放开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta! Get off! Get off of her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.20,1:45:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.48,1:45:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 凯妮斯 你脖子肿起来了 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Katniss. No, you're swollen. Don't touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.04,1:45:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 冷静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.68,1:45:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静下来 你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down. You're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.28,1:45:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她她醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her she's awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.04,1:46:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.76,1:46:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,比德很好 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peeta's okay. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.44,1:46:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是要把他先和你隔离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had to get him off you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.96,1:46:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫做「劫持」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called hijacking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.36,1:46:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道都城对他用药多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know how long the Capitol's been doing this to Peeta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.28,1:46:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是对于恐惧的条件反射\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fear conditioning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.84,1:46:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这与杀人毒蜂的介入有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enhanced with tracker jacker venom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.52,1:46:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在第一场饥饿游戏中被咬伤时 记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were stung your first Games. Remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.64,1:46:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒物会使人处于虚幻状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}The venom puts the subject in a dissociative state.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.60,1:46:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们虐待他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they torture him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.12,1:46:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用电击和殴打折磨他 直到摧毁他的精神意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}With shocks and beatings, and strip down his identity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.76,1:46:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把所有的痛苦和恐惧重新组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then all of that suffering and fear is redirected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.80,1:46:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成有着别的记忆的一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Associated with other memories or a person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.84,1:46:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以改变他对凯妮斯的记忆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can change his memories of Katniss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.00,1:46:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了看起来像她是一个致命的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make her seem life-threatening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.00,1:46:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把他变成了武器 凯妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They turned him into a weapon, Katniss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.16,1:46:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.96,1:46:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你可以解决吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can reverse it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.16,1:47:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧是最难以克服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fear is the most difficult thing to overcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.12,1:47:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,心中记得的恐惧比什么都重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hardwired to remember fear best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.96,1:47:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新的领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's new terrain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.84,1:47:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们已经有新的团队在研究了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've put together a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.84,1:47:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况很乐观的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm optimistic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.48,1:47:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.04,1:47:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天 我授权了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, I authorized{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.80,1:47:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个在都城内的救援行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}a covert rescue mission inside the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.44,1:47:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴得宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am pleased to announce{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.12,1:47:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的胜利者都已经获救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the Victors have been liberated!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.68,1:48:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这一天赋上了新的历史意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let this day mark an historic change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.68,1:48:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了嘲笑鸟和胜利者们\N{\fnArial\fs30}With The Mockingjay and the Victors beside us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.08,1:48:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经对都城发出了一段明确的讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have sent a clear message to the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.76,1:48:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我们将不再忍受他们的不公正的待遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we will never again endure injustice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.24,1:48:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.64,1:48:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就像一个大家庭团聚在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}a day on which we reunited family, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.32,1:48:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友和亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}friends, and loved ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.76,1:48:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,让施惠国的大家一起团结起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let all of Panem come together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.68,1:48:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再为了娱乐都城而战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to battle for the amusement of the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.56,1:48:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要齐心协力 肩并肩反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to join hands in this fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.52,1:48:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,让今天成为我们再次承诺的见证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let today be the day we promise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.20,1:48:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不放弃 永不投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}never to give up, never to give in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.00,1:48:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们打造新的施惠国\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we have made a new Panem, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.08,1:49:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个民选领导者 不再强加思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}where leaders are elected, not imposed upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.60,1:49:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,各区可以自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where the districts are free{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.64,1:49:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,分享他们的劳动成果…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to share the fruits of their labors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.04,1:49:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平共处互助互利\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not fight one another for scraps!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.64,1:49:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的施惠国就在前方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This new Panem is on the horizon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.00,1:49:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要靠自己努力才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we must take it for ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.24,1:49:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在通往崎岖蜿蜒的山路\N{\fnArial\fs30}The road there leads through the sharp mountains{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.60,1:49:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在深藏地底的第２区\N{\fnArial\fs30}and deep ravines of District 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.84,1:49:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是施惠国的心脏地带\N{\fnArial\fs30}There in the heart of Panem's steepest mountain range lies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.64,1:49:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有着都城所有的军事武力\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Capitol's principal military facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.92,1:49:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以直夺大本营\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can conquer this stronghold{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.88,1:49:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们是同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we are one people, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.08,1:49:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一支军队 有同一个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}one army, one voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.72,1:49:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为今天是一个崭新的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because today is our new beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.44,1:50:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们解放了所有胜利者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today we have freed the Victors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.04,1:50:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天 就是施惠国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow, Panem!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.28,1:50:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,必胜 必胜 必胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoorah! Hoorah! Hoorah!{\r}
